1
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:49,879
That's great.

2
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,840
Good, good, good.

3
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,359
Xiuming, say something. Speak up.

4
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:52,879
Right, exactly.

5
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:55,000
Wait, for this new company,

6
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,879
how will equity be split among the three parties?

7
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,159
Who's going to be the legal representative?

8
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,079
Who gets the biggest share?

9
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:00,799
Dad,

10
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,480
have you thought all this through?

11
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,040
Your Uncle Wei has run businesses the longest.

12
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,000
He's got plenty of experience.

13
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,879
We'll just follow his lead,

14
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:08,360
and that'll be enough.

15
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,199
Right, exactly.

16
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:10,599
Matters like this...

17
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,879
can be discussed later.

18
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,560
No rush.

19
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:13,360
Right.

20
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,240
No rush at all.

21
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,000
That's all for later.

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,360
Never mind about later.

23
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,520
Let me remind you of something.

24
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,680
You said it yourself just now,

25
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,039
didn't you?

26
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:19,840
You had a cerebral hemorrhage,

27
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:20,479
and you haven't even recovered yet.

28
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,840
Uncle Duoxi is about to go into surgery.

29
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:23,960
Uncle Wei is 70.

30
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,919
What kind of business can you guys even run?

31
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,680
Let's take a step back.

32
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:28,680
Even if you really do go through with it,

33
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:30,840
who's going to be in charge?

34
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:33,360
Xiuming.

35
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,000
Xiuming knows the worksite inside and out.

36
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:36,840
As for the legal representative,

37
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:38,240
he... he can definitely take it on.

38
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:38,879
Dad.

39
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,120
We juniors will listen to the elders.

40
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,680
Xiuming, say something.

41
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,639
Eldest Brother, no offense,

42
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,120
but you didn't even finish high school.

43
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,479
Just stick to manual labor.

44
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,319
You running a company?

45
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,280
Could you even manage it?

46
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,439
If I hand the books over to you,

47
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:51,479
could you even make sense of them?

48
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:52,840
You're just a foreman,

49
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,240
you know that?

50
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:53,680
Don't get ahead of yourself.

51
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,919
Xiuhe, how can you talk to your brother like that?

52
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,520
Don't think

53
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,719
I don't know what you're up to.

54
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,120
You've finally got your chance, haven't you?

55
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,400
Now the books belong to you,

56
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,439
and the keys will be yours too.

57
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,840
Got what you wanted, didn't you?

58
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:02,919
Playing the fool to strike...

59
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:03,360
You've waited a long time for this, haven't you?

60
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:03,840
Come on, Third Brother.

61
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,759
You don't get what the elders mean, do you?

62
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,759
The construction team is our bread and butter.

63
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,479
Growing the business is a good thing.

64
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:11,000
That way, everyone gets fed down the line.

65
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,080
Right, Uncle Wei?

66
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,000
Keep acting. Put on your little show.

67
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,560
Xiuhe.

68
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,159
Here's how it is with the finances.

69
00:03:16,439 --> 00:03:16,840
Well,

70
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,240
on our family's side,

71
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,879
his aunt will take charge.

72
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,319
Don't you guys have Qingyou?

73
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,199
And Changfu.

74
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,919
They have finance staff and accountants.

75
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:25,520
Don't worry.

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,000
Nobody's going to get shortchanged.

77
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:27,840
Brother-in-law,

78
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,520
let me make my stance clear.

79
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,000
As for these books,

80
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:31,919
I really can't manage them.

81
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,280
Let me remind you,

82
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,039
you've already divided the family assets.

83
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:36,520
The money that's left

84
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,159
is your retirement fund.

85
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:39,680
We still need to tread carefully.

86
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:40,520
Besides,

87
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,879
managing accounts is one thing,

88
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,960
and being the legal representative is another.

89
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:44,879
When it comes to running daily operations,

90
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,840
who's actually going to take charge?

91
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,319
None of that has been settled yet.

92
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,479
I think before that happens,

93
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,319
it's best nobody rushes in headlong.

94
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,039
Fair enough.

95
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,520
Running things takes someone who knows what they're doing.

96
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,280
Your eldest brother knows what he's doing.

97
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,120
Xiuming...

98
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,879
well,

99
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,039
the way I see it,

100
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:01,120
it's not that I don't trust you,

101
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,120
but the three elders are getting on in years.

102
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,680
Everything down the line depends on the successor.

103
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:09,560
This isn't just about putting your head down and working.

104
00:04:09,759 --> 00:04:10,560
It takes connections and networking.

105
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:14,639
There'll be tons of people to deal with down the road.

106
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,160
My big brother has a point.

107
00:04:18,439 --> 00:04:18,959
Right?

108
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:20,439
Running a company isn't that easy. I mean...

109
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:21,879
You need to know finance, tax, and law.

110
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:22,959
What's more,

111
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:24,399
merging all three family businesses,

112
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:26,519
that capital must be in the tens of millions.

113
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,199
With such big business,

114
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,279
shouldn't we find someone who knows what they're doing?

115
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:31,879
Laibu is right.

116
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,360
And it has to be someone all three families trust.

117
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:34,959
Isn't that Xiuming?

118
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:36,120
Are you guys done yet?

119
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,600
Are we eating or not?

120
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:39,120
It's the Double Ninth Festival today.

121
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,759
Can't we let Dad, Uncle Wei, and Uncle Ma

122
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:42,680
just enjoy a nice, warm meal?

123
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,759
What's all the arguing about?

124
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,560
What's so hard about this?

125
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:47,040
We have someone like that right here.

126
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,040
My second brother.

127
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:48,959
Second Brother?

128
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:49,879
Today, he doesn't even

129
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:51,639
have the right to sit at this table.

130
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,199
And you want him to run a company?

131
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:54,240
If he runs a company,

132
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,560
he'd strangle someone first.

133
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,079
Right?

134
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,279
Come on, Third Brother, why are you...

135
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,279
Cut the talk about death on a holiday!

136
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:00,600
Dad,

137
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,319
can I say something?

138
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,199
Go ahead.

139
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,959
Dad, your surgery will definitely go well.

140
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:07,199
Uncle Ma will get better too.

141
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:09,560
And Uncle Wei is still hale and hearty, in his prime!

142
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,560
With you three elders at the helm,

143
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:12,920
and my big brother

144
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,879
just following orders,

145
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,040
our three families will only get better and better.

146
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:16,560
Better and better?

147
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,480
Can you guarantee that?

148
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,240
Uncle Ma,

149
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,279
I might sound harsh,

150
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,040
but your construction crew...

151
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,879
it's a total money pit.

152
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:23,000
If we sink all our demolition payout into it

153
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:23,920
and lose everything, what then?

154
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,839
Will you take the blame?

155
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:25,879
Can you even afford to take the blame?

156
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,279
What's all this about losing money?

157
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:29,079
Uncle Ma's crew is doing just fine.

158
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,279
And I've been managing it just fine.

159
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:31,439
Have you managed it well?

160
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:32,079
Sai Xiuhe,

161
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,720
do you think your Sai family crew

162
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,480
is any better?

163
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,439
We're doing all right.

164
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,279
Hate to break it to you,

165
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:38,160
but our crew really is better than yours.

166
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:38,600
Got it?

167
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,480
Think about it carefully.

168
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,560
Xiuming knows the ins and outs of all three families.

169
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:43,879
Sai Xiuhe, what do you mean?

170
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,480
Xiuming,

171
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,439
what's your angle here?

172
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,399
Do you still want to work for me or not?

173
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:49,160
Come on, let's have a drink together first.

174
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:50,279
Come on.

175
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,399
Here's to a successful surgery.

176
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:52,839
Old Ma,

177
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,079
a speedy recovery.

178
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,399
Cheers, cheers.

179
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:58,000
Here's to health and peace for the three of us.

180
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,680
Get back here! Come back!

181
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,560
Take it out on me, not my eldest!

182
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,639
That's Old Ma's... that's my brother-in-law's!

183
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:05,120
Don't stop him! Let's see what he tries today!

184
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:19,160
The sun rises and the moon sets,

185
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,360
amidst the trivial chores of everyday life,

186
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,600
as the days roll on by themselves.

187
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,560
In the blink of an eye,

188
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,360
Sai Duoxi was admitted to the hospital,

189
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,319
and the surgery was scheduled.

190
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,079
Thank you for coming to see me.

191
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,360
No need to be so polite.

192
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,959
After this period of recuperation,

193
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:38,839
it's really shown great results.

194
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,000
You're looking good.

195
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:40,879
Thank you, thank you.

196
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:41,879
How have you felt these past couple of days?

197
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:42,959
Pretty good, pretty good.

198
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,480
Roughly when

199
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:46,439
will the surgery be?

200
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,480
Don't worry just yet.

201
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,920
We'll do a CT scan first.

202
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:51,079
Then once all your indicators

203
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:52,920
are back to normal,

204
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,920
we'll schedule it for

205
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,120
five days from now.

206
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,199
Surgery in five days.

207
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,879
Dad, don't worry.

208
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:00,199
Professor He Jia is an authority in urology.

209
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,160
Yes, of course.

210
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,000
We'll follow your guidance.

211
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:02,560
Whatever you say.

212
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,000
Great, great.

213
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,199
Just get some good rest.

214
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:04,480
Okay.

215
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:04,759
All right.

216
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,480
Sure, sure.

217
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,439
Mr. Shi, let me give you a quick update.

218
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,079
All the media outlets have confirmed,

219
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:12,000
and so have the other guests.

220
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,120
We'd also like to invite you

221
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,000
to grace us with your presence

222
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,040
on the opening day,

223
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,000
and offer your guidance.

224
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:17,959
If you can make it,

225
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,920
it will be a great honor for Qifan.

226
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:20,680
All right.

227
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:21,759
Here's what I think.

228
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,839
Let's hold our signing ceremony

229
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,279
right on your opening day.

230
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,319
When you unveil your firm's plaque,

231
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,680
our friends will all be there,

232
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,040
consider it an official announcement.

233
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,079
That would be fantastic!

234
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:33,000
We'll... we'll finalize the contract right away.

235
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,759
Great, great.

236
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,600
Attorney Sai,

237
00:07:35,839 --> 00:07:38,120
once we sign, we're all family.

238
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,439
Changfu must be won.

239
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:42,439
Rest assured.

240
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,959
We're already making preparations.

241
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,240
It's on the 16th?

242
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:48,120
Yes, the morning of the 16th.

243
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,079
Listen,

244
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,879
change my flight on the 16th.

245
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:51,959
We'll land in Shanghai in the afternoon,

246
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:52,800
have dinner in the evening,

247
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:53,959
and keep my morning clear.

248
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,879
S—sorry, let me take this call.

249
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:56,360
Go ahead.

250
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,040
Go ahead.

251
00:07:59,199 --> 00:07:59,600
Xiuliang,

252
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,160
Dad's surgery has been scheduled.

253
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:02,000
It's on the morning of the 16th.

254
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:22,120
Next, Chen Ming.

255
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:35,879
Thanks.

256
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,240
Why don't you tell me about yesterday's place again?

257
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:40,759
Sure.

258
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,759
That unit from yesterday

259
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,840
also has a really great layout.

260
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,360
There's definitely no issue with the build quality.

261
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:45,320
As for the formaldehyde smell...

262
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,320
I'll throw in some extras for you then.

263
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,159
Just keep the windows open often.

264
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:48,000
Kevin, see our guest out.

265
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,440
Right away!

266
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:48,960
Thanks for your help.

267
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,240
Sure.

268
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:49,840
Don't let me keep you.

269
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,360
All right, take care.

270
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,000
Sai Xiuhe!

271
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:53,000
What time do you call this?

272
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:55,840
What, is my little place too small for you now?

273
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,399
Mark him down on the attendance sheet!

274
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,080
Late again.

275
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,360
Watch your step!

276
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:01,919
Safety first!

277
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,039
Take it easy, everyone!

278
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,120
Biaozi!

279
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,639
Wait there for me!

280
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,440
I'll be right down!

281
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:17,720
I think

282
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,000
this one suits you better.

283
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,240
Dad,

284
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:42,759
it's so cold out here.

285
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,759
Let's go back inside.

286
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:45,840
You still have surgery coming up.

287
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,559
Zhenzhu's mom,

288
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,279
look at this tree.

289
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:03,159
I reckon

290
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,279
it's about my age.

291
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,600
When I arrived in Qingyangli,

292
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,919
its trunk was only as thick as a bowl.

293
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,600
I was an orphan.

294
00:10:12,919 --> 00:10:14,879
My parents died fleeing the famine.

295
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:17,200
I was only four back then,

296
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,000
and I nearly died too.

297
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,240
Lucky for me, I ran into the PLA,

298
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,799
and they brought me to our village.

299
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:26,039
That's how I survived.

300
00:10:26,799 --> 00:10:28,440
I didn't even know my own surname.

301
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Later on,

302
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,480
they found a fortune-teller.

303
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,480
He counted on his fingers

304
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:36,919
and said,

305
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,200
"Let's go with the surname Sai."

306
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:39,919
"It's a good name."

307
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:43,679
"Sai Duoxi, Sai Duoxi."

308
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,519
That's how I got my name.

309
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:48,919
I just drifted along like that,

310
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:51,279
until I married your mother-in-law.

311
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,480
Only then

312
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:53,879
did I put down roots.

313
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,759
You know, your mother-in-law...

314
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,799
She never had an easy life.

315
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:04,120
She never even wore a decent outfit.

316
00:11:06,879 --> 00:11:07,919
When she passed away,

317
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,080
her padded pants still had patches on them.

318
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:14,399
Later,

319
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,159
I married Lao San and Lao Si's mother.

320
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:19,159
The kids slowly grew up.

321
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:22,000
Just when life was looking up,

322
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:26,039
she fell ill too.

323
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:29,080
She suffered so much.

324
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:34,840
But looking back,

325
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:38,440
my life has been worth living.

326
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:41,120
I married two wives in my time,

327
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,000
and both were so beautiful,

328
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:44,879
and virtuous.

329
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,960
The kids take after their mothers,

330
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,080
each better-looking than the last.

331
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,720
But neither of them

332
00:11:54,519 --> 00:11:56,279
ever enjoyed an easy life with me.

333
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,080
And now,

334
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,960
our home will soon be gone too.

335
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,919
The roots I worked so hard to put down...

336
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,799
are about to be severed again.

337
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:11,360
Once this village gets demolished,

338
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,159
in the future,

339
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,639
I won't even know where I'll be buried.

340
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:25,759
Zhenzhu's mom,

341
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,240
let me ask something of you.

342
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,919
If this time...

343
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,480
if I really don't make it...

344
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,879
you must bury me with your mother-in-law

345
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:38,559
and Lao San and Lao Si's mother.

346
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,320
Move our graves together.

347
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,679
Don't leave me all alone.

348
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:46,600
Okay, Dad.

349
00:12:47,279 --> 00:12:47,679
Okay.

350
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,840
Dad, don't think like that.

351
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,279
We—we have the specialist from Beijing, right?

352
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,240
And Jingran is keeping an eye on things.

353
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:57,720
Nothing will go wrong.

354
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,519
Zhenzhu's mom,

355
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,000
this time,

356
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,720
once I'm on the operating table,

357
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,120
our family...

358
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:07,639
I'm putting it in your hands.

359
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:08,840
Dad, Dad...

360
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:10,799
Don't worry.

361
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,840
I'll take good care of our family for you.

362
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,440
Dad,

363
00:13:33,679 --> 00:13:34,559
It's as if we're speaking face to face.

364
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,720
I have two things to share with you.

365
00:13:37,799 --> 00:13:39,840
The firm just signed its first decent deal.

366
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:41,679
The hardest days...

367
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,080
are finally behind us.

368
00:13:44,679 --> 00:13:45,200
Second,

369
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,600
my resignation from the port authority was approved.

370
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,360
This uniform of mine...

371
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,039
I've taken it off for good.

372
00:13:53,559 --> 00:13:54,039
Dad,

373
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:56,080
I'm writing this today...

374
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,039
not to argue,

375
00:13:57,799 --> 00:13:59,799
but to swallow my pride and ask one thing of you.

376
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:03,000
Your surgery is set for the 16th.

377
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,240
Yet, of all days,

378
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:06,480
my firm's opening ceremony...

379
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,480
got locked into that exact date.

380
00:14:09,679 --> 00:14:10,919
With both clashing at the worst time,

381
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,039
I can't be in two places at once.

382
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,279
I've failed you as a son.

383
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,399
I won't be able to wait outside during your surgery.

384
00:14:19,639 --> 00:14:20,200
This hurdle...

385
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,320
I just can't get past it.

386
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:25,200
All I can do is swallow my pride and beg for your pardon.

387
00:14:27,159 --> 00:14:27,799
And please,

388
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:30,039
believe in me just this once.

389
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,720
I broke my iron rice bowl to strike out on my own...

390
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,039
because I didn't want you, my sheltering tree,

391
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,240
to shield me from the storms anymore.

392
00:14:37,159 --> 00:14:39,399
I wanted to grow into a tree of my own.

393
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,519
The 16th...

394
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:42,919
is your hurdle,

395
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,039
and it's mine, too.

396
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,240
So let's both, father and son,

397
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,440
test our mettle from afar.

398
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,480
You face the jaws of death,

399
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,240
and I'll cross my single-log bridge.

400
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,840
We'll both make it through.

401
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,639
Your unfilial son,

402
00:14:55,799 --> 00:14:56,960
Sai Xiuliang, bowing with deep respect.

403
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:08,960
Um...

404
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:11,320
Why is everyone waiting out here?

405
00:15:11,679 --> 00:15:13,000
Dad told us to wait outside.

406
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:16,879
Dad,

407
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,120
what are you doing?

408
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:25,159
You're about to have surgery,

409
00:15:25,399 --> 00:15:26,399
why do you need all this cash?

410
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,840
Don't worry about it.

411
00:15:27,919 --> 00:15:28,840
I have my reasons.

412
00:15:30,799 --> 00:15:31,200
And here,

413
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,480
my ID and bank card.

414
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:33,480
Take these.

415
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,039
Keep them safe for Dad.

416
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:36,159
Wait...

417
00:15:36,639 --> 00:15:37,799
Why should I hold onto them?

418
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:39,039
Think about it.

419
00:15:39,799 --> 00:15:40,559
The hospital stay,

420
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:41,840
meals,

421
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:42,799
medical bills...

422
00:15:42,919 --> 00:15:44,039
Don't they all cost money?

423
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:45,360
You keep them.

424
00:15:45,759 --> 00:15:46,559
You spend it for me.

425
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,559
Sister-in-law is here more often,

426
00:15:50,639 --> 00:15:51,639
let her keep them.

427
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:53,679
Not her.

428
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:55,879
Dad is only giving them to you.

429
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:56,600
You take them.

430
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:58,320
All right,

431
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,080
I'll hide them safely.

432
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:00,600
Good.

433
00:16:01,879 --> 00:16:02,519
Fourth,

434
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,759
of all Dad's children,

435
00:16:07,799 --> 00:16:09,399
you're the one I worry about most.

436
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,759
If this time...

437
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,559
if something unexpected happens to me,

438
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:18,200
no matter how much your brothers kick up a fuss,

439
00:16:18,879 --> 00:16:20,519
you make sure you hold onto your share.

440
00:16:20,679 --> 00:16:21,519
Bite your tongue! Spit it out!

441
00:16:21,679 --> 00:16:22,519
Knock on wood!

442
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:23,120
Hurry!

443
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:23,919
Knock on what wood?

444
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:25,080
Knock! Three times, hurry!

445
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,519
Knock, knock, knock.

446
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:26,639
Honestly...

447
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:27,919
What are you talking about?

448
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:28,720
What unexpected thing?

449
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,679
Nothing's going to happen!

450
00:16:29,679 --> 00:16:30,639
You'll definitely pull through.

451
00:16:30,639 --> 00:16:31,080
You hear me?

452
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,200
Just think of it as taking a nap in there.

453
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,559
You close your eyes, open them,

454
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,320
and it's all done.

455
00:16:35,399 --> 00:16:36,039
You hear me?

456
00:16:36,559 --> 00:16:38,000
Dad will listen to you. I will.

457
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,320
Is Jingran out there?

458
00:16:41,399 --> 00:16:42,080
Call him in.

459
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,320
Go on.

460
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:44,960
Okay.

461
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:45,759
Go.

462
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:50,759
Dad wants you inside.

463
00:16:55,279 --> 00:16:56,200
Dad, you wanted to see me?

464
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:07,880
Here are your scans.

465
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,720
Take it. Keep it.

466
00:17:14,759 --> 00:17:15,200
Dad, Dad...

467
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:16,720
You don't need to grease palms for surgery.

468
00:17:16,839 --> 00:17:17,359
There's no need.

469
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:20,000
It's not for bribing the doctors.

470
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,680
Qianjin doesn't have a job right now.

471
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,279
Everything falls on your shoulders.

472
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:25,240
This money is for emergencies.

473
00:17:25,599 --> 00:17:26,279
Just hold onto it for now.

474
00:17:29,559 --> 00:17:30,279
Listen to me.

475
00:17:31,559 --> 00:17:32,480
Right now,

476
00:17:33,039 --> 00:17:34,400
you're not getting any younger.

477
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:37,000
You can't just keep waiting like this.

478
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:37,480
You know?

479
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:38,440
You have to

480
00:17:38,799 --> 00:17:40,240
take the initiative.

481
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,279
That department head position...

482
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:44,920
Fight for it if you can.

483
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,079
Did you hear me?

484
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:49,640
Thank you, Dad.

485
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,279
No need to thank me.

486
00:17:51,759 --> 00:17:53,599
This isn't just for you.

487
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,119
It's also for

488
00:17:56,119 --> 00:17:56,960
Qianjin.

489
00:17:58,359 --> 00:17:59,279
A man

490
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,400
needs a career.

491
00:18:00,839 --> 00:18:01,880
Once you have a career,

492
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:03,319
life's difficulties

493
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:04,240
become easier to solve.

494
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,519
Qianjin has always been willful.

495
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,160
You have to be patient with her

496
00:18:09,599 --> 00:18:10,599
and look after her.

497
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,119
Don't worry, Dad.

498
00:18:13,599 --> 00:18:14,559
I'll definitely take good care of her.

499
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,400
Good, good.

500
00:18:23,839 --> 00:18:24,400
Hello, President Shi.

501
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,799
What made you decide to partner

502
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:26,920
with Qifan Law Firm?

503
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:27,960
Well, it's like this:

504
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:30,400
In Honggang, Tengyue Group

505
00:18:30,519 --> 00:18:31,480
will be making some major moves.

506
00:18:31,799 --> 00:18:33,880
Our criteria for choosing partners are simple.

507
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:34,880
Let's get ready to start.

508
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,960
Everyone, we're about to begin.

509
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,440
And as for Qifan Law Firm,

510
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,400
in this regard...

511
00:18:40,599 --> 00:18:41,640
Hello, everyone. Hello!

512
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,559
Please gather toward the stage.

513
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:44,079
Thank you.

514
00:18:44,559 --> 00:18:45,480
Thank you all. Thank you.

515
00:18:46,519 --> 00:18:47,440
All right, no problem.

516
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,279
Let's catch up in private.

517
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:48,720
Okay.

518
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,279
Sure, sure.

519
00:18:49,319 --> 00:18:50,880
Distinguished guests and leaders,

520
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,519
welcome to the opening ceremony

521
00:18:53,519 --> 00:18:55,920
of Honggang Qifan Law Firm.

522
00:18:59,559 --> 00:19:00,640
Today,

523
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,480
we are deeply honored to welcome

524
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:05,160
Tengyue Group's East China Regional President,

525
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,000
who is also Qifan Law Firm's

526
00:19:07,279 --> 00:19:09,480
most steadfast supporter and partner,

527
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:10,480
Mr. Shi Yongnian.

528
00:19:11,319 --> 00:19:11,759
Welcome!

529
00:19:17,359 --> 00:19:17,960
As well as

530
00:19:18,119 --> 00:19:20,480
a partner of Qifan Law Firm,

531
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,599
Mr. Sai Xiuliang.

532
00:19:21,759 --> 00:19:22,079
Great.

533
00:19:29,359 --> 00:19:29,680
Wait.

534
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:30,720
Stop, stop, stop.

535
00:19:31,759 --> 00:19:33,319
Phone, my phone!

536
00:19:33,799 --> 00:19:34,440
I have it right here.

537
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:50,319
All set, Doctor. Thank you.

538
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,400
Hang in there, Grandpa!

539
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,359
Don't be nervous, Dad.

540
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:55,119
Everything will go smoothly.

541
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:56,920
We'll all be outside waiting for you.

542
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:06,480
Okay. Okay.

543
00:20:07,559 --> 00:20:08,240
Here's to thriving business!

544
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:12,720
Next, we invite

545
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:15,119
Mr. Shi Yongnian and Mr. Sai Xiuliang

546
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,119
to jointly sign

547
00:20:16,119 --> 00:20:18,680
this momentous strategic cooperation agreement.

548
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,160
Gentlemen, please take your seats.

549
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:27,000
Congratulations.

550
00:20:32,799 --> 00:20:34,759
People say to take life and death lightly,

551
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,599
but when life and death are on the line,

552
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,559
no one can truly let it go.

553
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,839
Things you can't let go of,

554
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,039
there might not be any.

555
00:20:45,039 --> 00:20:46,559
But people you can't let go of,

556
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,799
there's always someone.

557
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,319
Please pose together for a photo.

558
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:28,960
Are you Sai Duoxi?

559
00:21:31,359 --> 00:21:31,839
Speak up.

560
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:32,960
Is your name Sai Duoxi?

561
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,160
Yes, Sai Duoxi.

562
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,440
The surgery will be over soon.

563
00:21:36,599 --> 00:21:37,160
Don't be nervous.

564
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,359
Just relax.

565
00:21:39,559 --> 00:21:40,400
All right, let's begin.

566
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:00,920
It's still early.

567
00:22:01,359 --> 00:22:01,839
Have a seat.

568
00:22:22,279 --> 00:22:22,559
Hello?

569
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:23,799
How's Dad?

570
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,319
It's already started.

571
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:27,279
When Dad went in, he kept looking around.

572
00:22:27,599 --> 00:22:28,519
He was probably looking for you.

573
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,000
When are you coming over?

574
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:31,960
Hello?

575
00:22:33,759 --> 00:22:34,119
Xiuliang?

576
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:58,839
I'm here. I'm here.

577
00:22:59,480 --> 00:22:59,960
What floor?

578
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,079
Okay, I'm coming up.

579
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:18,200
Xiuliang.

580
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:20,400
How long has he been in?

581
00:23:20,759 --> 00:23:21,400
Nothing went wrong, right?

582
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:21,960
I'm asking you!

583
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:23,519
For such a major surgery,

584
00:23:23,519 --> 00:23:25,079
what couldn't wait?

585
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:25,640
Sai Xiuliang!

586
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,440
Once Dad went in,

587
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:27,160
Sai Xiuliang!

588
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:27,759
will he even make it out?

589
00:23:27,759 --> 00:23:28,319
I'm asking you!

590
00:23:28,839 --> 00:23:29,519
What were you doing?

591
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:32,640
Acting tough with Dad, a cancer patient?

592
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:34,759
The whole family's been running around here,

593
00:23:34,759 --> 00:23:35,480
and what were you doing?

594
00:23:35,599 --> 00:23:36,440
You're so above it all!

595
00:23:36,599 --> 00:23:37,519
Like you're the only one with a career!

596
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,200
Get the hell back to your law firm!

597
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,160
Get out! Go!

598
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,119
Why haven't you left yet?

599
00:23:41,599 --> 00:23:41,920
Go!

600
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:42,559
Get out!

601
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:43,519
I told you to get out!

602
00:23:43,759 --> 00:23:44,039
Get out!

603
00:23:44,440 --> 00:23:45,559
Go! Get the hell out!

604
00:23:45,559 --> 00:23:46,200
Get the hell out of here!

605
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:47,359
Get out! Just leave!

606
00:23:47,359 --> 00:23:48,160
Big Brother! Big Brother!

607
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,480
Let's just talk this through!

608
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:50,559
Xiuming, stop it! Xiuming!

609
00:23:50,559 --> 00:23:52,480
I said get out! Leave!

610
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:52,799
Let go!

611
00:23:52,799 --> 00:23:53,759
I told you to get out!

612
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:54,400
Stop fighting!

613
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:56,240
Xiuming, this is a hospital! Let go!

614
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:56,960
Get the hell out!

615
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:57,720
Stop fighting!

616
00:23:58,279 --> 00:23:59,039
So now you know...

617
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,839
to finally show up, is that it?!

618
00:24:02,119 --> 00:24:02,599
What's going on?

619
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:03,680
What do you think you're doing?

620
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,680
There's a surgery going on! Don't you know that?

621
00:24:36,279 --> 00:24:39,319
Labor, equipment, materials for both sites—

622
00:24:39,319 --> 00:24:40,519
split between three partners.

623
00:24:40,519 --> 00:24:41,039
Old Ma!

624
00:24:44,599 --> 00:24:45,759
You're sitting up already!

625
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:47,880
Look at you,

626
00:24:48,759 --> 00:24:50,480
you're recovering so fast!

627
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:56,000
Look at that stubble.

628
00:24:56,799 --> 00:24:57,559
What's with you?

629
00:24:57,799 --> 00:24:58,400
Pulling a long face...

630
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,119
Don't want to see me?

631
00:24:59,559 --> 00:25:01,000
I really don't want to see you.

632
00:25:01,759 --> 00:25:02,799
Whenever Yang Er shows up,

633
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:03,799
it's never any good.

634
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:04,759
That's not necessarily true.

635
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,400
How much did you drink

636
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:07,559
to get like this?

637
00:25:08,319 --> 00:25:09,119
When you three drink together,

638
00:25:09,359 --> 00:25:10,519
you're always the one who loses out.

639
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:13,440
Old Ma, let me give you an analogy.

640
00:25:13,759 --> 00:25:15,359
Sai Duoxi is like hard liquor.

641
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:16,759
Wei Changfu

642
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,200
is like rice wine.

643
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:19,160
And you?

644
00:25:19,599 --> 00:25:21,200
At best, you're beer.

645
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,839
If you mix the three together,

646
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,119
can anyone drink that?

647
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,559
Put into the same pot,

648
00:25:25,759 --> 00:25:26,519
how could things not go wrong?

649
00:25:27,039 --> 00:25:28,319
You three even want to merge!

650
00:25:28,759 --> 00:25:29,440
They'll call the shots,

651
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:30,599
and you'll just be an underling.

652
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:31,799
Not to lecture you,

653
00:25:32,079 --> 00:25:33,319
but you're already this old

654
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:34,599
and still have no backbone.

655
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,000
Just running along behind Sai Duoxi.

656
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:36,680
Second Brother Yang,

657
00:25:37,119 --> 00:25:38,160
who told you that?

658
00:25:39,759 --> 00:25:41,839
Wei Changfu will definitely want to be top dog.

659
00:25:42,599 --> 00:25:44,720
Sai Duoxi uses his illness to stay hidden,

660
00:25:45,119 --> 00:25:46,960
putting Sai Xiuming out as a front.

661
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,079
As for Sai Xiuming,

662
00:25:48,519 --> 00:25:50,440
he jumps when told and never steps out of line.

663
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:51,559
Doesn't he have to listen to his dad?

664
00:25:52,079 --> 00:25:53,200
You really take things easy,

665
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:53,759
don't you?

666
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:54,839
Letting this piece of work

667
00:25:55,799 --> 00:25:57,559
keep your books and watch the construction site?

668
00:25:57,559 --> 00:25:58,920
Can she even handle it?

669
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:00,119
A woman,

670
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:01,359
and an outsider with a different surname to boot.

671
00:26:01,799 --> 00:26:03,240
Those two will walk all over her!

672
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:04,920
Instead of that,

673
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,640
you'd be better off working with me.

674
00:26:07,319 --> 00:26:09,079
I've got demolition money.

675
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:10,079
I'm not short on cash.

676
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:10,759
Second Brother Yang,

677
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:12,480
that's no way to talk.

678
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:13,480
What's wrong with women?

679
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:15,039
Can't a woman manage accounts?

680
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:16,400
Aren't I better than those two nephews?

681
00:26:16,839 --> 00:26:17,319
Yang Er,

682
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:19,440
who told you to come here?

683
00:26:19,519 --> 00:26:20,799
Does... does anyone need to tell me?

684
00:26:21,279 --> 00:26:22,440
Our village is only so big.

685
00:26:22,559 --> 00:26:24,319
What news could possibly not get out?

686
00:26:25,279 --> 00:26:26,039
Let me tell you,

687
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:28,200
I may be sick,

688
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,000
but I'm not senile.

689
00:26:30,279 --> 00:26:32,799
What the three of us discussed behind closed doors,

690
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:35,240
how do you know every single detail?

691
00:26:35,480 --> 00:26:38,039
Isn't there a traitor right inside our home?

692
00:26:38,039 --> 00:26:38,359
Dad...

693
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:40,720
I told him. It was me.

694
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:43,279
They're doing this

695
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:44,440
for our own good.

696
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,240
There are things they can't just say outright.

697
00:26:46,559 --> 00:26:47,839
Look at what a mess the Sai family is in.

698
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:49,319
Sai Duoxi is in the hospital,

699
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,519
and it's not even certain he'll make it out.

700
00:26:50,799 --> 00:26:52,319
They can barely save their own skins,

701
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:54,640
so we have to look out for ourselves.

702
00:26:54,839 --> 00:26:55,680
Listen to what the kid is saying.

703
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,839
It's not about what I want right now—

704
00:26:58,519 --> 00:26:59,119
Second Brother Yang,

705
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,200
look how upset you've made my brother-in-law.

706
00:27:01,759 --> 00:27:03,480
Half his body is already paralyzed.

707
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,559
If you keep going,

708
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:05,200
the other half

709
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:06,559
will be on you.

710
00:27:07,839 --> 00:27:09,559
Medical care is so expensive these days.

711
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:12,200
You don't want to become the next Sai Duoxi, do you?

712
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,880
No wonder they put her in charge.

713
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:15,119
She sure knows how to kick people out.

714
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:16,319
One word and we're leaving.

715
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,079
Old Ma,

716
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:19,799
our partnership,

717
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,119
it's like—

718
00:27:21,279 --> 00:27:21,759
See that?

719
00:27:22,359 --> 00:27:23,599
A dream team.

720
00:27:23,599 --> 00:27:24,000
All right,

721
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:24,839
I'll wait to hear from you.

722
00:27:24,839 --> 00:27:25,160
Brother,

723
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,640
get well soon.

724
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:28,519
Hurry up and leave.

725
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,000
Take care now.

726
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:30,599
Have a proper talk with your dad.

727
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:31,599
See you in a couple of days.

728
00:27:32,519 --> 00:27:32,799
You got it.

729
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,440
Oh, Dad,

730
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:38,480
don't be mad at me anymore.

731
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:40,079
I'm doing this for our family's sake, aren't I?

732
00:27:40,319 --> 00:27:41,680
Think about the market competition these days.

733
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,839
Running a construction team is so tough!

734
00:27:43,119 --> 00:27:43,759
While Yang Er wants it,

735
00:27:43,759 --> 00:27:44,920
we should hand it over to him right away!

736
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:48,519
Dad

737
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:52,880
You hit me?

738
00:27:53,079 --> 00:27:53,880
What right do you have to hit me?!

739
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:55,079
Because I'm your father!

740
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,000
I just don't get it.

741
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,079
Did you owe the Sai family in your past life?

742
00:27:57,079 --> 00:27:57,640
Lao San,

743
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:58,079
while you're alive,

744
00:27:58,079 --> 00:27:59,279
I busted my back for this construction team.

745
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,720
And when you die, I'm entitled to a share too!

746
00:28:00,759 --> 00:28:01,920
What's with all this "dead or alive" talk?

747
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,640
Ma Laibu!

748
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,559
Got your share of the money,

749
00:28:03,559 --> 00:28:04,599
so I can't keep you in line anymore, huh?

750
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,279
Hao Zhihua!

751
00:28:06,079 --> 00:28:07,039
Me calling you "Auntie" before

752
00:28:07,039 --> 00:28:07,960
was just out of respect for my mom!

753
00:28:08,079 --> 00:28:08,759
Who the hell do you think you are?

754
00:28:08,759 --> 00:28:10,000
I'm your aunt!

755
00:28:10,240 --> 00:28:10,559
Dad!

756
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,039
She's your sister-in-law!

757
00:28:12,119 --> 00:28:12,759
Let me tell you once more

758
00:28:12,759 --> 00:28:13,359
what she's really after!

759
00:28:13,359 --> 00:28:14,160
Get out of the way! Stay out of this!

760
00:28:14,599 --> 00:28:15,359
Do you know what kind of

761
00:28:15,359 --> 00:28:16,200
shady scheme she's cooking up?

762
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,440
Her real goal right now is

763
00:28:17,559 --> 00:28:19,480
to use our Ma family construction team as a dowry

764
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,759
and marry into the Sai family!

765
00:28:20,759 --> 00:28:21,960
Ma Laibu, what kind of bullshit are you talking?!

766
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:22,640
Shut up!

767
00:28:23,319 --> 00:28:23,759
Get out!

768
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,400
Get the hell out!

769
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,279
Dad! Dad! Dad!

770
00:28:32,559 --> 00:28:33,039
Dad!

771
00:28:34,079 --> 00:28:35,400
Why are you standing up?

772
00:28:40,799 --> 00:28:41,240
Brother-in-law,

773
00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:43,960
about this ledger,

774
00:28:44,519 --> 00:28:45,319
here's what I'm thinking.

775
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:47,559
I'll be really busy later on,

776
00:28:47,759 --> 00:28:48,720
and won't have much time,

777
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,720
but the site needs close watching.

778
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,279
So what I'm thinking is,

779
00:28:53,599 --> 00:28:55,119
why not let Jiao learn to check the books?

780
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:55,720
No, don't do that.

781
00:28:55,799 --> 00:28:56,880
For site matters from now on,

782
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:57,720
I won't be signing anymore.

783
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,279
Let Jiao sign.

784
00:28:58,599 --> 00:29:00,359
Don't be like that, Auntie.

785
00:29:01,039 --> 00:29:02,640
Ma Laibu is just a jerk.

786
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,880
No matter how much of a jerk he is,

787
00:29:04,079 --> 00:29:05,160
he's still my nephew.

788
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:06,880
I wouldn't stoop to his level.

789
00:29:07,079 --> 00:29:07,599
Right, of course.

790
00:29:07,799 --> 00:29:08,640
Get some good rest.

791
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:09,720
Jiao,

792
00:29:10,839 --> 00:29:11,319
learn the ropes.

793
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:12,920
Auntie.

794
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:14,079
Call me if there's anything you don't get.

795
00:29:14,079 --> 00:29:14,440
Auntie...

796
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:16,279
Auntie, please keep an eye on things for now.

797
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:19,720
All right, Dad.

798
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:20,599
Drop it.

799
00:29:21,039 --> 00:29:22,079
Let's head inside and rest.

800
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:23,359
Wait a second.

801
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:24,279
Jiao.

802
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,319
That thing about your aunt

803
00:29:26,599 --> 00:29:27,640
and Sai Xiuhe just now,

804
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:28,759
did you know about it?

805
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:30,240
I had no idea.

806
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:30,960
Really?

807
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,880
Even if there is something,

808
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,960
it's Xiuhe pursuing my aunt.

809
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:35,519
Wait.

810
00:29:35,839 --> 00:29:36,960
Doesn't that mess up the family order?

811
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,759
How... how could Sai Xiuhe do such a thing?

812
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,200
She's your mother's sister!

813
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:41,559
Come on.

814
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:44,519
Auntie is barely older than Xiuhe anyway.

815
00:29:44,519 --> 00:29:45,759
That's still unacceptable!

816
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,119
It defies all propriety!

817
00:29:47,559 --> 00:29:48,279
I know, I know.

818
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:49,079
Don't get upset.

819
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:49,759
Totally improper!

820
00:30:30,599 --> 00:30:31,319
Xiuming,

821
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:32,839
hold on a second.

822
00:30:32,839 --> 00:30:33,599
Let me find a quieter spot.

823
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,640
Xiuming,

824
00:30:39,119 --> 00:30:40,599
my dad asked me to check

825
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,200
how Uncle Duoxi is doing.

826
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:44,920
He's not out yet.

827
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,160
Once he's out,

828
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:47,839
let me know.

829
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,200
Sure.

830
00:30:49,759 --> 00:30:50,119
By the way,

831
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:52,440
about the shipping orders from yesterday and today,

832
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,160
give me a couple of days.

833
00:30:53,160 --> 00:30:53,720
Once I'm done here,

834
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:54,480
I'll bring them over.

835
00:30:55,279 --> 00:30:55,920
No rush.

836
00:30:57,519 --> 00:30:59,160
If anything happens at the site from now on,

837
00:30:59,240 --> 00:30:59,960
just come to me.

838
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,759
My aunt isn't handling it anymore.

839
00:31:02,359 --> 00:31:03,440
Why isn't she handling it?

840
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:06,359
Oh, right.

841
00:31:07,920 --> 00:31:09,000
Your third brother

842
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,079
seems to be going after my aunt.

843
00:31:11,319 --> 00:31:11,880
Did you know that?

844
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:12,920
Who?

845
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,160
Who's going after who?

846
00:31:14,799 --> 00:31:16,680
Your third brother, Sai Xiuhe.

847
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,799
He seems to be chasing my aunt.

848
00:31:19,119 --> 00:31:19,960
You didn't know?

849
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,720
That totally messes up the family seniority!

850
00:31:21,759 --> 00:31:22,680
If my dad finds out about this,

851
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:24,559
he'll be infuriated to death.

852
00:31:25,359 --> 00:31:26,680
Uncle Duoxi is a good man blessed with luck.

853
00:31:27,039 --> 00:31:27,960
He'll definitely be fine.

854
00:31:28,599 --> 00:31:29,759
Once my dad gets through this,

855
00:31:30,359 --> 00:31:31,519
I'll teach that kid a real lesson.

856
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:38,119
Family of Sai Duoxi?

857
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,119
Coming! Grandpa's coming out!

858
00:31:40,359 --> 00:31:40,640
Dad!

859
00:31:42,519 --> 00:31:42,839
Dad!

860
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:43,480
Dad!

861
00:31:43,880 --> 00:31:44,599
The surgery went smoothly.

862
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:45,920
Transfer him to the ICU.

863
00:31:46,599 --> 00:31:47,680
Why does he need to go to the ICU?

864
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,200
There was some bleeding during surgery.

865
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:51,000
To be safe, we need to observe him overnight.

866
00:31:51,279 --> 00:31:52,000
Don't worry, though.

867
00:31:52,599 --> 00:31:53,359
It won't be for long.

868
00:31:53,359 --> 00:31:54,359
Wh-When will he wake up?

869
00:31:54,359 --> 00:31:54,880
Xiuming!

870
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:55,440
Very soon.

871
00:31:55,599 --> 00:31:56,240
It won't take long.

872
00:31:56,359 --> 00:31:57,359
Dad's out, Xiuming!

873
00:31:57,359 --> 00:31:58,240
Get off the phone!

874
00:31:59,240 --> 00:31:59,799
I've gotta go,

875
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:00,440
my dad's out.

876
00:32:24,559 --> 00:32:25,359
The doors are open.

877
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,079
Family members, please stay outside.

878
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,279
What time is it?

879
00:32:40,799 --> 00:32:41,200
Xiuli.

880
00:32:41,519 --> 00:32:42,920
Take Zhenzhu and head back first.

881
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:43,720
She has school tomorrow.

882
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:44,359
Xiuming.

883
00:32:44,839 --> 00:32:45,519
Take them back.

884
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,279
I've got things covered here.

885
00:32:46,440 --> 00:32:47,319
Go on home, all of you.

886
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:49,920
Sister-in-law, go home and get some rest too.

887
00:32:50,319 --> 00:32:51,400
I'm on the night shift tonight.

888
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,799
We'll really need people later on.

889
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:53,960
Everyone, get some good rest.

890
00:32:56,799 --> 00:32:57,359
Qianjin.

891
00:32:57,720 --> 00:32:59,119
Have your second brother drive you.

892
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,400
Jingran, we'll leave things to you then.

893
00:33:01,599 --> 00:33:02,880
Call me if anything comes up.

894
00:33:04,039 --> 00:33:04,440
Let's go.

895
00:33:05,079 --> 00:33:05,559
Let's head back.

896
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,039
Qingyou said

897
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:23,279
that about Dad's illness,

898
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,519
everyone on the construction site knows now.

899
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:25,279
The word has spread.

900
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:26,480
Who spread it?

901
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,079
Who else could it be?

902
00:33:28,079 --> 00:33:29,559
Must be Yang Er and his big mouth.

903
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:30,359
Not necessarily.

904
00:33:30,759 --> 00:33:32,160
It could be that punk from the Ma family.

905
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:34,759
Ma Laosan got a bit of chump change from relocation,

906
00:33:35,039 --> 00:33:36,200
and now walks around with his nose in the air.

907
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:38,400
Now he's scheming to fleece Old Man Ma,

908
00:33:38,599 --> 00:33:39,519
but the old man has nothing left.

909
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:41,000
So he's eyeing his family's construction team,

910
00:33:41,119 --> 00:33:42,039
talking about selling it for cash.

911
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:42,799
He wouldn't dare!

912
00:33:43,119 --> 00:33:44,519
I keep an eye on the Mas every single day!

913
00:33:44,519 --> 00:33:46,240
You? Can you even spot a bad guy?

914
00:33:46,799 --> 00:33:47,319
If someone sold you out,

915
00:33:47,319 --> 00:33:48,160
you'd help them count the cash!

916
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,559
You talk big about other people's business.

917
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:50,920
Let me tell you,

918
00:33:51,359 --> 00:33:52,400
why don't you explain to me first...

919
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:53,359
what is going on

920
00:33:53,880 --> 00:33:54,880
between you and the Ma family's aunt?

921
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:55,359
What's the deal?

922
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,359
Give me a straight answer!

923
00:33:56,519 --> 00:33:57,680
What's there to explain?

924
00:33:57,799 --> 00:33:58,640
A man and a woman—

925
00:33:58,720 --> 00:33:59,680
isn't it obvious what's going on?

926
00:34:00,119 --> 00:34:00,799
She's a generation above you!

927
00:34:00,799 --> 00:34:01,440
Don't mess around!

928
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,279
I'm going after her,

929
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:03,799
so what?

930
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:05,079
So what if she's the Mas' aunt?

931
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,240
Which law says

932
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,559
Sai Xiuhe can't pursue the Mas' aunt?

933
00:34:07,559 --> 00:34:08,199
That we can't be together?

934
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:09,519
I... I say you can't, so you can't!

935
00:34:09,519 --> 00:34:10,960
Your words mean nothing! I'm pursuing her!

936
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:16,679
Acting reckless, are you?

937
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:17,320
Get out of the car!

938
00:34:18,679 --> 00:34:19,719
Fine, I will!

939
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:41,800
Hold on, hold on.

940
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:49,199
A buddy of mine runs this place.

941
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:50,840
If you want to go there,

942
00:34:51,079 --> 00:34:51,880
I'll put in a good word for you.

943
00:34:55,519 --> 00:34:56,039
And one more thing,

944
00:34:56,639 --> 00:34:58,000
with the old man's condition right now,

945
00:34:59,159 --> 00:35:00,800
he really needs Jin Jingran.

946
00:35:01,119 --> 00:35:02,519
I know you feel wronged, but...

947
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,159
just bear with it for now.

948
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,280
Don't pick a fight with him yet.

949
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:10,400
You hear me?

950
00:35:14,079 --> 00:35:14,440
I'm heading out.

951
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:40,400
You're back.

952
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:43,440
Do you want some?

953
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:44,679
Something to eat?

954
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,559
You cooked this?

955
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,119
Yes, I cooked it.

956
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:05,000
Relax.

957
00:36:05,239 --> 00:36:06,119
It's not poisoned.

958
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:07,440
I came here to find my dad,

959
00:36:07,599 --> 00:36:09,639
not to hurt you, stepmom.

960
00:36:10,559 --> 00:36:11,119
What mom?

961
00:36:11,639 --> 00:36:12,159
Stepmom.

962
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:13,320
You're calling me "mom"?

963
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:19,239
The mom who came after.

964
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:20,360
After.

965
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:22,320
Who's your stepmom?

966
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:23,119
I'm not that old.

967
00:36:23,440 --> 00:36:24,920
I couldn't have a kid your age!

968
00:36:25,159 --> 00:36:26,159
I-I'm still young!

969
00:36:26,159 --> 00:36:27,320
I'm a... I'm a young lady!

970
00:36:27,320 --> 00:36:28,039
Okay. Young, young, young.

971
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:28,719
Okay, eat, eat, eat.

972
00:36:29,039 --> 00:36:30,039
Tell me, how does it taste?

973
00:36:32,559 --> 00:36:33,039
Is it good?

974
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:34,800
Well?

975
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:38,519
Passable.

976
00:36:39,159 --> 00:36:39,639
What do you mean?

977
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:41,360
Just so-so.

978
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:42,320
What?

979
00:36:44,119 --> 00:36:44,840
So-so.

980
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:47,199
What do you mean so-so? How could it be so-so?

981
00:36:48,079 --> 00:36:49,440
No way it's just so-so!

982
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:50,920
Why?

983
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:53,440
I don't use chopsticks. I use a fork.

984
00:36:56,440 --> 00:36:57,679
You call this so-so?

985
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:59,000
It's so good!

986
00:36:59,360 --> 00:36:59,920
Oh my God!

987
00:37:00,559 --> 00:37:01,880
I knew I was great at cooking!

988
00:37:02,559 --> 00:37:04,079
It's great. You just don't want to admit it.

989
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:04,800
That's fine.

990
00:37:05,239 --> 00:37:06,320
Growing up, it was just me and my mom.

991
00:37:06,559 --> 00:37:07,920
We did everything ourselves,

992
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,519
like clearing pipes, fixing cars,

993
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:10,079
and anything else.

994
00:37:10,639 --> 00:37:12,199
That's why I'm good at cooking.

995
00:37:12,559 --> 00:37:14,000
A whole bunch of babble.

996
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:15,320
I didn't understand a single thing.

997
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:16,079
What?

998
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:19,079
Speak Chinese. Don't speak English.

999
00:37:22,039 --> 00:37:22,599
Grandpa...

1000
00:37:23,039 --> 00:37:23,519
today's...

1001
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:25,559
surgery...

1002
00:37:26,639 --> 00:37:27,280
did it go well?

1003
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:29,840
Who's your grandpa?

1004
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,920
My dad calls your dad "Dad."

1005
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,960
So your dad is my grandpa.

1006
00:37:34,079 --> 00:37:34,599
Do you understand?

1007
00:38:06,760 --> 00:38:07,239
Mom,

1008
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:10,440
please watch over Dad.

1009
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:23,440
Sai Xiuli, you know a lot.

1010
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:25,159
Is Grandpa really that sick?

1011
00:38:29,199 --> 00:38:30,199
If Grandpa passes away...

1012
00:38:30,559 --> 00:38:31,079
Don't be afraid.

1013
00:38:31,599 --> 00:38:32,480
You can live with us.

1014
00:38:33,119 --> 00:38:33,639
Don't worry.

1015
00:38:34,159 --> 00:38:34,800
Dad will be fine.

1016
00:38:35,719 --> 00:38:36,400
Besides,

1017
00:38:36,679 --> 00:38:37,519
I'm almost an adult now.

1018
00:38:38,199 --> 00:38:38,960
I can live on my own.

1019
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:40,559
Then register under our household,

1020
00:38:40,880 --> 00:38:41,880
spend New Year's with us,

1021
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:42,920
and when you get married,

1022
00:38:42,920 --> 00:38:44,159
my parents will pay your bride price.

1023
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:48,679
What's this?

1024
00:38:49,480 --> 00:38:51,239
China's King of Medicine and the West's Father of Medicine.

1025
00:39:28,039 --> 00:39:28,840
How's Dad?

1026
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:51,519
Here, have some water.

1027
00:40:05,119 --> 00:40:06,159
Don't worry too much.

1028
00:40:07,119 --> 00:40:08,559
Your dad is blessed with good fortune,

1029
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:10,360
he'll definitely pull through this.

1030
00:40:14,119 --> 00:40:15,360
Let's have a baby.

1031
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:21,159
Where did that come from all of a sudden?

1032
00:40:23,639 --> 00:40:24,440
To have another loved one.

1033
00:40:27,159 --> 00:40:27,679
I remember

1034
00:40:28,639 --> 00:40:29,920
the old man once said,

1035
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:32,199
if people only care about their own comfort

1036
00:40:34,079 --> 00:40:34,960
and don't have kids,

1037
00:40:35,679 --> 00:40:36,840
it's pure selfishness.

1038
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:40,960
Those who have kids without a second thought

1039
00:40:42,079 --> 00:40:44,000
only care about what the child can give them.

1040
00:40:44,400 --> 00:40:46,039
Someone like me, who's thought it over and over,

1041
00:40:47,039 --> 00:40:48,159
is the one who truly cares about

1042
00:40:48,559 --> 00:40:49,760
what I can offer the child.

1043
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:51,440
Who are you calling selfish?

1044
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:59,119
When someone falls ill,

1045
00:41:01,639 --> 00:41:02,719
it's sheer misery.

1046
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:05,519
Seeing Dad lying in the hospital bed,

1047
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:09,000
with so many tubes hooked up to him,

1048
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:15,039
it really breaks your heart.

1049
00:41:24,039 --> 00:41:26,079
You shouldn't have treated Xiuliang like that today.

1050
00:41:29,039 --> 00:41:30,400
He's lucky I didn't slap him in the face.

1051
00:41:31,159 --> 00:41:33,039
He's your biological brother, after all.

1052
00:41:33,039 --> 00:41:35,079
Born of the same mother and father.

1053
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:39,199
With just one word from you,

1054
00:41:39,199 --> 00:41:40,360
he wasn't even allowed to come home.

1055
00:41:40,360 --> 00:41:41,719
And now you're feeling sorry for him?

1056
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:45,519
It's just that Dad is sick,

1057
00:41:45,519 --> 00:41:46,880
and I can't bear to see it.

1058
00:41:49,519 --> 00:41:50,840
Falling ill...

1059
00:41:51,679 --> 00:41:53,519
It sounds simple enough when you say it,

1060
00:41:55,519 --> 00:41:56,519
but whoever has to go through it,

1061
00:41:57,639 --> 00:41:58,519
it's really tough to endure.

1062
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:03,800
Tell me,

1063
00:42:04,800 --> 00:42:07,400
who did Dad leave the compensation passbook with?

1064
00:42:08,239 --> 00:42:10,119
I thought he'd give it to Xiuliang,

1065
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:11,960
but the second son couldn't even come home,

1066
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:14,639
so Dad didn't have time to hand it over.

1067
00:42:16,119 --> 00:42:17,559
You really have a way of talking...

1068
00:42:18,480 --> 00:42:19,840
jumping all over the place.

1069
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,519
To put it bluntly,

1070
00:42:25,519 --> 00:42:26,519
if Dad were still healthy,

1071
00:42:26,519 --> 00:42:27,480
I wouldn't take this lying down.

1072
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:29,679
The way he played favorites...

1073
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:31,000
It was so completely unfair.

1074
00:42:31,559 --> 00:42:32,400
He went way too far.

1075
00:42:33,599 --> 00:42:34,320
Even a meek rabbit

1076
00:42:34,519 --> 00:42:34,840
will get pushed to the edge

1077
00:42:34,840 --> 00:42:35,840
and bite back!

1078
00:42:37,119 --> 00:42:38,400
But now that he's sick,

1079
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:44,840
he's shut all our mouths.

1080
00:42:46,559 --> 00:42:48,000
Whoever brings this up now

1081
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,480
is a total bastard.

1082
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:52,840
Aren't you exhausted?

1083
00:42:53,039 --> 00:42:54,559
Dwelling on this crap all day long.

1084
00:42:54,559 --> 00:42:55,199
What are you doing?

1085
00:42:55,480 --> 00:42:56,119
Let's go to sleep.

1086
00:42:57,280 --> 00:42:57,639
Turn off the light.

1087
00:43:02,599 --> 00:43:04,159
Listen, is that a noise from Dad's room?

1088
00:43:05,599 --> 00:43:06,360
Listen, listen.

1089
00:43:07,800 --> 00:43:08,199
Do you hear it?

1090
00:43:20,039 --> 00:43:21,559
Help me up first.

1091
00:43:22,039 --> 00:43:23,719
I'm a sick man!

1092
00:43:24,079 --> 00:43:25,760
Where do you think you're going?

1093
00:43:25,760 --> 00:43:26,840
Uncle Ma, let go of me!

1094
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:27,480
Let me tell you.

1095
00:43:27,599 --> 00:43:28,400
Today, this stuff...

1096
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:29,239
you take it if you want to,

1097
00:43:29,440 --> 00:43:30,480
and you take it even if you don't!

1098
00:43:30,840 --> 00:43:32,599
I'm not letting you leave!

1099
00:43:33,519 --> 00:43:34,719
I told you to call the second brother!

1100
00:43:34,719 --> 00:43:35,559
I'm not calling! Why should I?

1101
00:43:35,559 --> 00:43:36,039
You call him!

1102
00:43:36,039 --> 00:43:36,559
I— You call him!

1103
00:43:36,559 --> 00:43:36,960
You call!

1104
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:37,280
I won't!

1105
00:43:37,280 --> 00:43:37,920
If you don't call, I'll hit you!

1106
00:43:37,920 --> 00:43:38,840
I'll call! I'll call, I'll call!

1107
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:39,599
Brother Liang!

1108
00:43:39,719 --> 00:43:40,280
Sai Xiuliang!

1109
00:43:40,440 --> 00:43:41,440
Get over here within half an hour!

1110
00:43:41,440 --> 00:43:41,960
Did you hear me?

1111
00:43:42,079 --> 00:43:42,599
Get here right now!

1112
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:44,719
Right, right, right, so, you—

1113
00:43:45,800 --> 00:43:46,280
He hung up.

1114
00:43:46,400 --> 00:43:46,719
You...
